Subject: [PATCH] [FSW-2067] fs1: phy fw prepare & copy - trigger fsm

-trigger pcie fw fsm to copy pcie sram locations and
pcie csr locations to the phy
-wait for fsm_phy_init_done

Change-Id: I39824d05ef044d246bb052d7c643f3303739cc94
Signed-off-by: Erez Shaul <eshaul@habana.ai>
---

